content.text:
The fee for 12-installment credit sales depends on your plan. The sources list these figures:

- **Receiving in 2 business days:** 1.98% for installment sales, plus an additional 2.73% per month [sup-taxas-04].
- **"Receba conforme suas vendas" plan:** 6.40% for installment sales, with no additional monthly fee [sup-taxas-04].
- **Credit 7x to 12x:** 3.15% + 0.90 per transaction (Antifraude). Receipt is in 31 days plus 30 days per installment [sup-duvidas-53].

There is also a discount on 12 installments [sup-duvidas-85]. To get it, you must:
- bill at least R$1 in debit and credit;
- be in good standing;
- keep the D2 receiving term enabled;
- keep your contracted machine model.

The sources don't say which of these fees applies to your account. I can pass your case to a human agent to confirm that if you'd like.
